"当前用户不能写这个配置文件（它可能属于其他用户），因此修改需要管理员权限。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:204
msgid ""
"These settings affect the Docker daemon for the whole machine and every "
"user. Changing them needs administrator rights."
msgstr ""
"这些设置影响整台机器、所有用户共用的 Docker 守护进程，修改需要管理员权限。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:214
msgid ""
"The running Docker daemon is a system service, so it does not read this "
"file. Making changes here take effect needs administrator rights (or a "
"rootless daemon)."
msgstr ""
"正在运行的 Docker 守护进程是系统服务，不会读取这个文件。要让这里的改动生效需"
"要管理员权限（或改用 rootless 守护进程）。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:215
msgid ""
"The running Docker daemon is rootless, so it does not read this file. "
"Changes here only affect a system-wide daemon."
msgstr ""
"正在运行的 Docker 守护进程是 rootless 的，不会读取这个文件。这里的修改只对系"
"统级守护进程生效。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:224
msgid ""
"Settings are read-only until you unlock them. Unlocking asks for "
"administrator rights; the authorization lasts about five minutes."
msgstr "解锁前这些设置是只读的。解锁需要管理员权限，授权大约持续五分钟。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:232
msgid ""
"Unlocked. Saving and restarting will not ask again for about %1 seconds."
msgstr "已解锁。约 %1 秒内的保存与重启不会再询问授权。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:248
msgid ""
"This file is yours to change. The running daemon is a system service, so "
"making the change take effect needs administrator rights."
msgstr ""
"这份配置属于你自己，可以直接修改；但正在运行的是系统级守护进程，要让改动生效"
"需要管理员权限。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:249
msgid ""
"The Docker data directory is inside your home directory, but the daemon "
"itself runs as a system service: this file belongs to the system, so "
"changing it needs administrator rights."
msgstr ""
"Docker 数据目录位于你的家目录中，但守护进程本身以系统服务运行：这份配置属于系"
"统，修改它需要管理员权限。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:257
msgid ""
"The configuration file could not be parsed (%1). It is shown read-only; "
