msgid ""
"The saved registry mirrors are not active yet. Restarting the Docker service "
"will stop running containers; those with a restart policy will come back "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"已保存的镜像加速器尚未生效。重启 Docker 服务会停止正在运行的容器；设置了重启"
"策略的容器会自动恢复。"

